            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A back cover for a mobile device, the back cover comprising an electrochromic film device attached to a back of the mobile device, wherein the electrochromic film device includes: an electrochromic layer; a charge storage layer comprising a metal oxide; and a suspension encapsulated between two films, the suspension comprising a mixture having a crystalline phase below a transition temperature of the mixture and an isotropic liquid phase above the transition temperature, the mixture being adjusted in tint in response to a temperature increasing to above the transition temperature</p>
            </abstract>
